# =============================================================================
# Spatial autocorrelation (SAC) in freshwater ecosystems: a systematic review
# R script to reproduce all figures of the main text and the supplement
# =============================================================================
#
# Output (written to the folder set in `out_dir`, section 1.2)
#
#   Main text
#     fig2_literature_overview.png     Figure 2  Geographic and temporal distribution
#     fig3_habitat_taxa_climate.png    Figure 3  Habitats, spatial scale, taxa, climate
#     fig4_objectives_factors.png      Figure 4  Objectives, factors and processes
#     fig5_sac_range.png               Figure 5  Reported SAC ranges
#
#     (Figure 1, conceptual background, is prepared separately)
#
#   Supplement
#     figS2_sac_methods.png            Figure S2 Methods and spatial metrics

#     (Figure S1, screening flowchart, is prepared separately)
#
# Structure
#   1 Setup              packages, output folder
#   2 Data               load and clean the extraction table
#   3 Shared settings    colours, themes, helper functions
#   4-7                  Figures 2-5 (Figure 1 is conceptual and prepared separately)
#   8-11                 Figures S2-S5 (Figure S1 prepared separately)
#   12                   Image credits (PhyloPic)
#
# Run the script from top to bottom: later sections reuse objects created in
# earlier ones (noted at the start of each section).
#
# Unit of analysis: one row of the extraction table = one analysis; several
# analyses can come from the same study (Study_ID).
#
# Requirements: R >= 4.1, ggplot2 >= 3.5, patchwork >= 1.2. Install packages once:
#   install.packages(c("googlesheets4", "tidyverse", "patchwork", "rnaturalearth",
#                      "rnaturalearthdata", "countrycode", "rphylopic", "kgc",
#                      "RColorBrewer", "openxlsx", "lme4", "lmerTest", "car", "sf", "grid"))
# PhyloPic silhouettes and the base map are downloaded at run time (internet needed).
# =============================================================================


